---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About MarqDesk" description="Learn what MarqDesk is: a free, fast collection of simple online tools for students and everyday tasks.">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-900 dark:text-brand-100">About MarqDesk</h1>
  <div class="prose mt-6 max-w-none leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
    <p>MarqDesk is a free collection of simple online tools for students and everyday tasks.</p>
    <p>The project started with a simple idea: the small calculations people do every day — percentages for grades, marks, attendance, discounts — should not require installing an app or creating an account. They should just work, instantly, in the browser.</p>
    <p>MarqDesk is built as a static website. That means pages load quickly, and every calculation runs directly on your device. Your inputs never leave your browser.</p>
    <p>The site is currently in its early stage and begins with student-focused tools. More tools will be added over time.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
